{"appid": 3410180, "gama": {"steamId": 3410180, "id": 3410180, "name": "Overlooting", "copiesSold": 134671, "unreleased": false, "earlyAccess": false, "firstReleaseDate": 1756684800000, "releaseDate": 1756684800000, "price": 9.99, "developers": ["Posing Possums"], "publishers": ["Posing Possums"], "publisherClass": "Indie", "reviewScore": 79, "genres": ["Adventure", "RPG", "Strategy"], "tags": ["Inventory Management", "Loot", "Roguelite", "Dungeon Crawler", "Pixel Graphics", "Roguelike", "RPG", "Character Customization", "Replay Value", "Turn-Based Combat", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Strategy", "Medieval", "Strategy RPG", "Auto Battler", "Fantasy", "Deckbuilding", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Turn-Based", "Singleplayer"]}, "store": {"type": "game", "name": "Overlooting - 掠夺传奇", "steam_appid": 3410180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新的黑暗力量正在腐蚀这个世界，几个角色为了击退他们，阴差阳错走到了一起。一个是出身显赫、备受爱戴的英雄马克西米兰，一个是多国通缉的传奇大盗利兹，还有一个是神秘的“暗影”，所有人之前都以为这个存在就是腐蚀的源头。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/d5959f757e68d15ab0ab4f5ea673701b.poster.avif?t=1791486348\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/d5959f757e68d15ab0ab4f5ea673701b.webm?t=1791486348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 你的主要任务是掠夺装备，每一件都属于一种套装。同一套装的武器装备一定数量之后，就能解锁强大的加成。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/b7da4d8db89e7a1fed4c75e72a61515d.poster.avif?t=1791486348\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/b7da4d8db89e7a1fed4c75e72a61515d.webm?t=1791486348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每局游戏都会有一棵技能树，每局都会变化，供你学习特殊技能。这些技能有些可以发挥通用的作用，有些能够直接提升你的战力，还有的可以令特定构筑突破上限。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/30c73e45f829986ef60dc8f7df9c8345.poster.avif?t=1791486348\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/30c73e45f829986ef60dc8f7df9c8345.webm?t=1791486348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每个区域到了最后，都会有一个头目阻止你完成任务。这类强敌具备特殊能力，会真正考验你的能力，所以路上每一步都要仔细考虑，才能做到无往不利！</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新的黑暗力量正在腐蚀这个世界，几个角色为了击退他们，阴差阳错走到了一起。一个是出身显赫、备受爱戴的英雄马克西米兰，一个是多国通缉的传奇大盗利兹，还有一个是神秘的“暗影”，所有人之前都以为这个存在就是腐蚀的源头。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/d5959f757e68d15ab0ab4f5ea673701b.poster.avif?t=1791486348\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/d5959f757e68d15ab0ab4f5ea673701b.webm?t=1791486348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 你的主要任务是掠夺装备，每一件都属于一种套装。同一套装的武器装备一定数量之后，就能解锁强大的加成。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/b7da4d8db89e7a1fed4c75e72a61515d.poster.avif?t=1791486348\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/b7da4d8db89e7a1fed4c75e72a61515d.webm?t=1791486348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每局游戏都会有一棵技能树，每局都会变化，供你学习特殊技能。这些技能有些可以发挥通用的作用，有些能够直接提升你的战力，还有的可以令特定构筑突破上限。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/30c73e45f829986ef60dc8f7df9c8345.poster.avif?t=1791486348\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/extras/30c73e45f829986ef60dc8f7df9c8345.webm?t=1791486348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每个区域到了最后，都会有一个头目阻止你完成任务。这类强敌具备特殊能力，会真正考验你的能力，所以路上每一步都要仔细考虑，才能做到无往不利！</p>", "short_description": "每一局游戏技能树都会变化，随机应变，同时合理搭配各种装备，令装备形成强大的联动效果，打造扭转胜负的角色构筑，击败拦在眼前的一个又一个头目。走进这款类Rogue背包管理游戏，每一局游戏都会让你感觉到不同的惊险和爽快！", "supported_languages": "英语, 法语, 德语, 简体中文, 俄语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 日语, 韩语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/3c190736be9165f842ca6cc91ba3629124d9d788/header_alt_assets_1_schinese.jpg?t=1791486348", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/4d2e27ddf94b852ceffcccb73a5bdca2119d0bbf/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1_schinese.jpg?t=1791486348", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410180/4d2e27ddf94b852ceffcccb73a5bdca2119d0bbf/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1_schinese.jpg?t=1791486348", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core  i3-3220<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><